     "Hi,<div><br></div><div>I have a question on my lavaan, as I enter a 9 factors form with 9 observations (raw data), and I use it to perform lavaan, but it says:</div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in lav_samplestats_icov(COV = cov[[g]], ridge = 1e-05, x.idx = x.idx[[g]],  : \r\n  lavaan ERROR: sample covariance matrix is not positive-definite</span></span></span><br></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\">\r\n<span style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87);font-family:Roboto,RobotoDraft,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">I would like to know what happen to my coding.</span></span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87);font-family:Roboto,RobotoDraft,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87);font-family:Roboto,RobotoDraft,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Thanks!</span></span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console