   "subject": "Re: Question on Lavaan error",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>This error is not about your code, it&#39;s about your data.</div><div><br></div>If you only have 9 observations, and your have 9 or more variables (I assume you do), the sample covariance matrix will be non-positive definite, and your model won&#39;t be able to run.<div><br></div><div>You need more observations. (A lot more, I suspect).</div><div><br></div><div>Jeremy</div><div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
